  "description": "DDIEM Ontology for the Drug Database for Inborn Errors of Metabolism. The DDIEM database is a database of therapeutic strategies and treatments for inborn errors of metabolism. These strategies are classified by mechanism and outcome using the DDIEM Ontology. The DDIEM database also includes descriptions of the phenotypes addressed by the treatment, together with drugs and procedures applied.",
